--- a/docs/factory/ROLE_HARDENING.md
+++ b/docs/factory/ROLE_HARDENING.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Role Hardening

+

+## A/B/C/D workers

+- Must stay inside declared scope lock.

+- Must emit required bundle artifacts.

+- Must not write to another worker bundle.

+

+## Z integrator

+- Must never invent features.

+- Must only merge, validate, report.

+- Must block run on missing required artifacts.


--- a/docs/factory/RUNBOOK.md
+++ b/docs/factory/RUNBOOK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Runbook

+

+## Standard Run

+1. Initialize run: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py init-run`

+2. Preflight: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py preflight --run-id <RUN_ID>`

+3. Create worktrees: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py worktrees create --run-id <RUN_ID>`

+4. Scaffold bundles: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py bundle-init --run-id <RUN_ID>`

+5. Workers execute scoped tasks and update bundles.

+6. Validate bundles: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py bundle-validate --run-id <RUN_ID>`

+7. Integrate: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py integrate --run-id <RUN_ID>`

+8. Open report: `python tools/codex/factory_cli.py open-report --run-id <RUN_ID>`

+

+## Required Evidence

+- `STATUS.json`

+- `FILES_CHANGED.json`

+- `DIFF.patch`

+- `LOGS/INDEX.json`


--- a/docs/factory/TROUBLESHOOTING.md
+++ b/docs/factory/TROUBLESHOOTING.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Troubleshooting

+

+## `AGENTS.md` missing

+Use fallback: `docs/factory/AGENTS_FALLBACK.md`.

+

+## Worktree create fails

+- Confirm branch name is valid.

+- Confirm local repo has git metadata.

+- Retry with `--dry-run` first.

+

+## Integration blocked by overlap

+- Review `SCOPE_LOCK.json` per worker.

+- Resolve ownership conflict.

+- Re-run `bundle-validate` and `integrate`.


